        "Navigate to /notices",
        "Search postcode S325UY",
        "Increase radius to 5km",
        "Click on a notice like 'The Pilot Inn'",
        "Click 'View Notice' button",
        "Verify notice details load (not 'notice not found')",
        "Verify can submit representation"
      ],
      "evidence": "Fixed missing supabase client declaration in server/routes/notices.ts:1105. Added 'const supabase = getServiceSupabaseClient();' before database query in GET /notices/:id endpoint. Also fixed same issue in GET /notices/:id/representations endpoint (line 1192) and POST /notices/:id/view endpoint (line 1262)."
    },
