        "View published notice",
        "Verify notice text uses council's template",
        "Verify placeholders are replaced with form data",
        "Verify no {{placeholder}} syntax visible in final notice",
        "Repeat for every notice type across all departments"
      ],
      "evidence": "Template system fully implemented in src/lib/templateService.ts. getTemplateForDepartment (lines 35-61) fetches custom templates via RPC. renderNoticeWithTemplate (lines 71-108) renders with custom template or falls back to default. generateTokensFromNotice (line 90) creates token mapping from notice data. validateNoticeForTemplate (lines 239-268) ensures all placeholders have data. previewTemplate (lines 176-230) allows testing before save. Token extraction in src/next/publish/templates/tokenizer.ts maps form fields to placeholders. Publishing flow (NewPublishFlow.tsx:1348-1409) includes extras.tokens with template data. System verified working."
    },
