    },
    "skip_payment_for_firms": {
      "description": "Skip payment step when using allowance",
      "passes": false,
      "priority": 5,
      "evidence": "Fully implemented in src/next/publish/flow/steps/PaymentStep.tsx with allowance checking. When firmSlug is provided, the component fetches the organization's subscription details and checks allowance using the can_publish_notice() database function. If within allowance, displays green success card showing remaining notices and skips Stripe payment. If overage, displays amber warning card with overage cost. Records usage via record_notice_usage() RPC before submitting. Green submit button replaces blue payment button when using allowance. NewPublishFlow.tsx passes firmSlug prop to PaymentStep (line 1666)."
    },
